{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01446",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 7.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like. Sorry about the wait, we're running a bit behind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.29,
      "end_seconds": 14.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Oh, that's fine. I was just reading something on my phone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.62,
      "end_seconds": 18.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Okay, what do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.1,
      "end_seconds": 27.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Um, so... the room spinning when I turn over in bed. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.56,
      "end_seconds": 31.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.13,
      "end_seconds": 39.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Actually, I'd say six months. Actually, no, closer to about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.52,
      "end_seconds": 49.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.43,
      "end_seconds": 81.73,
      "duration_seconds": 28.3,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. It's on and off. It's worse with looking up and turning in bed. I took the morning off to come in today. I've had being unsteady for a few minutes too, for about three months. As for being unsteady for a few minutes, I'd say moderate. I've also been feeling sick, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.3,
      "end_seconds": 95.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Have you noticed double vision or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.07,
      "end_seconds": 102.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.05,
      "end_seconds": 107.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Any hearing loss or ringing in the ear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.0,
      "end_seconds": 114.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.81,
      "end_seconds": 118.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.67,
      "end_seconds": 120.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.64,
      "end_seconds": 127.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.2,
      "end_seconds": 139.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "Oh, I had a reaction to diclofenac when I was younger, wheezing, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.63,
      "end_seconds": 142.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.87,
      "end_seconds": 154.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.57,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I swim twice a week. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.83,
      "end_seconds": 159.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.36,
      "end_seconds": 170.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, I've had anxiety for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.63,
      "end_seconds": 178.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "Yes, anxiety is known to us, good to have that clear. Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.59,
      "end_seconds": 184.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.62,
      "end_seconds": 190.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.08,
      "end_seconds": 194.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.22,
      "end_seconds": 208.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.44,
      "end_seconds": 218.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.96,
      "end_seconds": 237.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 81, temperature 37.0, SpO2 97 percent on room air, pressure 122 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.04,
      "end_seconds": 240.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.6,
      "end_seconds": 246.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.63,
      "end_seconds": 250.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.9,
      "end_seconds": 254.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.38,
      "end_seconds": 272.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "When I tip you back, the eyes flick for about twenty seconds, and the hearing is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.78,
      "end_seconds": 277.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "So, you can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.14,
      "end_seconds": 319.26,
      "duration_seconds": 23.12,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, this is probably benign positional vertigo. I'll do a repositioning manoeuvre now and show you exercises for home. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Let's plan a check in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 323.67,
      "end_seconds": 327.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I can put that appointment in for you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.91,
      "end_seconds": 331.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.66,
      "end_seconds": 337.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.65,
      "end_seconds": 341.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "That's clear, uh, thanks."
    }
  ]
}